# Proof-media masters (P2-A): heavy raw screenshots / screen-recordings that feed
# scripts/encode-proof.mjs + scripts/encode-video.mjs. NEVER shipped — only the
# encoded AVIF/WebP/MP4/WebM siblings in public/ ship. Keep the dir + README.
proof-masters/*
!proof-masters/.gitkeep
!proof-masters/README.md

# Showcase capture masters (showcase/theme-sync): raw dsf2 PNGs + raw clip webms
# banked under design-reviews/showcase-refresh/masters/ — NEVER committed; only
# the encoded siblings in public/showcase/ ship. (design-reviews/ itself stays
# untracked by convention; this line makes a stray add harmless.)
design-reviews/showcase-refresh/masters/

# Studio Archive seed: the prototype's personal catalogue, extracted by
# scripts/archive/extract-seed.mjs for one-time import. This repo is public and
# the data is Sky's — only the extractor script ships, never its output.
scripts/archive/out/
